---
import { contactLinks, projectLinks, personalMaxLink, projectMaxLink } from '../lib/site';

const footerContactLinks = [...contactLinks, personalMaxLink];
const footerProjectLinks = [...projectLinks, projectMaxLink];
---
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-grid"><div class="footer-about"><a class="footer-brand" href="/"><span>РОЗНИЦА</span>В ЦИФРАХ</a><p>Практические инструменты для розничной торговли и управления торговым бизнесом.</p></div><div><strong>Навигация</strong><a href="/articles/">Статьи</a><a href="/tools/">Инструменты</a><a href="/services/">Услуги</a><a href="/about/">Обо мне</a><a href="/contacts/">Контакты</a></div><div><strong>База знаний</strong><a href="/articles/category/prodazhi/">Продажи</a><a href="/articles/category/tovar/">Товар</a><a href="/articles/category/pokupatel/">Покупатель</a><a href="/articles/category/upravlenie/">Управление</a></div><div><strong>Документы</strong><a href="/privacy/">Персональные данные</a><a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie</a><a href="/offer/">Оферта</a><a href="/user-agreement/">Соглашение</a><button type="button" data-cookie-settings>Настройки аналитики</button></div></div><div class="container footer-social"><div><strong>Связаться со мной</strong>{footerContactLinks.map((link)=><a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={link.label}><i class={`ti ${link.icon}`}></i></a>)}</div><div><strong>Площадки проекта</strong>{footerProjectLinks.map((link)=><a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={link.label}><i class={`ti ${link.icon}`}></i></a>)}</div></div><div class="container copyright">© 2026 «Розница в цифрах»</div></footer>
<style>.site-footer{padding:2.7rem 0 1.25rem;background:var(--c-ink);color:#fff}.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,4rem)}.footer-about p{max-width:240px;color:#aab0b5;font-size:.78rem}.footer-brand{position:relative;display:inline-block;padding-left:20px;font-family:var(--font-editorial);font-size:1.15rem;line-height:.92;text-decoration:none}.footer-brand:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:3px;background:var(--c-orange)}.footer-brand span{display:block}.footer-grid>div:not(.footer-about){display:grid;align-content:start;gap:.4rem}.footer-grid strong,.footer-social strong{margin-bottom:.35rem;font-family:var(--font-editorial);font-size:.9rem}.footer-grid a,.footer-grid button{padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:#c9cdd1;font:inherit;font-size:.76rem;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}.footer-grid a:hover,.footer-grid button:hover{color:#fff}.footer-social{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;margin-top:2rem;padding-block:1rem;border-block:1px solid #ffffff18}.footer-social>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}.footer-social strong{margin:0 1rem 0 0}.footer-social a{display:grid;width:34px;height:34px;place-items:center;border:1px solid #ffffff18;border-radius:var(--r-sm);background:#151a1f;text-decoration:none}.footer-social i{color:#fff;font-size:1.2rem}.copyright{padding-top:1rem;color:#8d959c;font-size:.72rem}@media(max-width:768px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.footer-about{grid-column:1/-1}.footer-social{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}@media(max-width:430px){.site-footer{padding-top:1.5rem}.footer-grid{display:block}.footer-grid>div:not(.footer-about){padding-block:.8rem;border-top:1px solid #ffffff18}.footer-grid>div:not(.footer-about) a,.footer-grid>div:not(.footer-about) button{display:none}.footer-grid>div:not(.footer-about) strong{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.footer-grid>div:not(.footer-about) strong:after{content:'+'}.footer-social{margin-top:.5rem}.footer-social strong{min-width:120px;font-size:.8rem}}</style>
<style>.footer-grid .footer-brand{padding-left:24px!important}</style>
